{
  "_comment": "Wiring of all 15 LID-DS 2021 scenarios for protocol pulse-live-lidds-v1 (+ amendment 1). ${victim} -> victim pod IP at runtime. victim and exploit images are the dataset's (real vulnerable service, real exploit), built on .234 and imported to the workers (imagePullPolicy Never). Normal traffic is a generic per-scenario generator (image lidds-gen:latest): normal.request is a shell command hitting the victim, run once per sampled wait time. exploit.kind: exec = run commands[0]; chain = run commands in order; stdin = the exploit image is stdin-driven (its entrypoint loops on stdin), fed one blank line with entrypoint+args. ready.marker is informational; the driver waits for a readiness probe (httpGet 200 or tcpSocket).",
